# Form skill icons: 54 = 9 lines x 6 skills (skills.gd FORM_LIST), 16x16, no backing like icon_heart.
# Each line keeps its own accent ramp: Zombie green-grey, Skeleton bone, Wisp pale blue, Slime blue,
# Dragon orange-red, Beast brown, Nature leaf green, Material stone grey, Demon crimson.

